# The preview header set (lane 2, step 2.6): the production header set plus X-Robots-Tag: noindex (ADR 0006 part 1;
# the glossary's "preview header set"). The preview workflow adds this file to every preview; a build that carries its
# own _headers is refused. The build's hashed files under /assets/ never change, so they are cached for good.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
